Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.31 auto-save: Continue loads it, Load is its own title row

P6.31 follow-up (owner decision 2026-10-26). The auto-save is a separate card
file (autosave.bin). On the title menu, when that file exists and the native
overlay is on, Continue (row 2) loads it and the former Continue, which opens
the slot list, becomes a separate Load row (row 3); Quit game moves to row 4.
Without the file the menu is exactly as before (Continue opens the slot list,
Quit game is row 3).

menus/title/menu.c: the Down limit and the Quit row follow
dw3_port_title_quit_row(); Cross on Continue sets choice 4 when the Load row is
there. menus/title/title.c: choice 4 starts a Continue by hand: a new game's
state, the saved bytes (dw3_autosave_load checks the file again; the cheat mark
of autosave.cheats follows), then the saved field mode, as the load screen's
last step does. If the file cannot be read after all, it falls back to
MODE_CONTINUE (the slot list).

--- a/src/menus/title/menu.c
+++ b/src/menus/title/menu.c
@@ -221,9 +221,10 @@
         }
         if (PAD_PRESSED(PAD_DOWN) || PAD_REPEATED(PAD_DOWN)) {
 #if PORT_HOST
-            /* P6.28: Quit game is the last row, apart from Continue. */
+            /* P6.28: Quit game is the last row, apart from Continue (and,
+               P6.31, from the Load row an auto-save file adds). */
             if (task->selection < (dw3_port_title_quit_enabled() ?
-                                   DW3_TITLE_QUIT : DW3_TITLE_CONTINUE)) {
+                                   dw3_port_title_quit_row() : DW3_TITLE_CONTINUE)) {
                 SOUND.playSound(SOUND_CURSOR);
                 task->selection++;
             }
@@ -241,7 +242,7 @@
                 SOUND.playSound(SOUND_SELECT);
                 break;
             }
-            if (task->selection == DW3_TITLE_QUIT) {
+            if (dw3_port_title_quit_enabled() && task->selection == dw3_port_title_quit_row()) {
                 /* P6.28: ask first (Yes / No, the cursor on No). */
                 dw3_port_confirm_open(DW3_CONFIRM_QUIT);
                 SOUND.playSound(SOUND_SELECT);
@@ -257,10 +258,16 @@
         if ((++task->timer & 3) == 0) {
             task->timer = 0;
             if (++task->blink >= 3) {
-                if (task->selection != 0) {
+                if (task->selection == 0) {
+                    task->choice = 1;
+#if PORT_HOST
+                } else if (task->selection == DW3_TITLE_CONTINUE && dw3_port_title_load_row()) {
+                    /* P6.31: with an auto-save file, Continue loads it (the
+                       Load row below opens the slot list) */
+                    task->choice = 4;
+#endif
+                } else {
                     task->choice = 2;
-                } else {
-                    task->choice = 1;
                 }
                 task->nextSubstate(task);
                 task->blink = 0;
--- a/src/menus/title/title.c
+++ b/src/menus/title/title.c
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 #include "menus/title.h"
 #if PORT_HOST
 #include "port_title_options.h"
+#include "port_autosave.h"
